      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yea also agreed here\nThe Gestures on touch make it incredibly hard to not have a gesture down and active (even just trying to toggle gestures off is hard due to way to have to hold controllers to click thumbstick you most likly will hit a gesture and have it stuck)\n\nALSO\nThe thumb is way worse now ....\nThe first bone was what needed adjusting so it just didnt stick out /detach from the model \n\nBut it seems now the whole thumb is bent awkwardly and is perm bent even when doing thumbs up (on all avatars even defaults)\n\n\nI would just revert this change ... and instead take a second look at thumb bone again",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
