      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b079433a323326808b507fa|full_name}: Yeah exactly, it's just far too easy to do gestures now. Before you were at least able to have the gesture mode activated without having to worry about accidentally activating gestures just by normally holding your controller",
