  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-19T03:21:12.757Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The new changes to the knuckles look and feel even worse than before. In terms of looks, my thumbs now look even WORSE and more unnatural than they did last update. In terms of feel, the change that made it so you no longer have to squeeze the grip at all now to do gestures has made it far too easy to constantly and accidentally activate gestures. I couldn't even find a way to not use a gesture while holding my controllers anymore. Before it felt a bit too hard to activate the gestures (possibly because im on EV3s) but now it's the complete opposite, far too easy and my face basically spazzes out whenever I turn on gesture overrides now because of all the different gestures the game thinks im making just by normally holding my controllers\n\nBecause of the gesture swapping button also locking in your current gesture when you switch, my gestures get stuck way more often because it's hard to NOT do a gesture when you're holding your controller. Please at least switch it back to squeezing for now or at least make a different official preset or something for it in steamVR controller settings.",
